The controller drawing on the PAD tab (ui/src/js/27-pad-art.js) is adapted
from "Dualshock3 Layout.svg" by Tokyoship:

  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dualshock3_Layout.svg

Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported license:

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

Changes: the labels, the pointer lines, the maker's wordmark and logo, the
stick caps and the shoulder letters are removed; the greys are lifted; the
picture is cropped to the controller.
